{"sha": "764d3e3b32bb6735f88c04c895eea8518bfde746b68630908d11d652fcc0c0af", "body": ["\\textbf{9.} $F = PS = 1.013\\times10^5 \\times 20 = \\qty{2.0e6}{N}$ --- 两百", "吨；另一侧同样受该压强作用。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $P' = P \\times 303/293 = \\qty{1.048e5}{Pa}$；净压差 $\\Delta P\\,S = 3.5", "\\times10^3 \\times 20 = \\qty{70}{kN}$，方向向外，墙上相当于七吨。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 空气流出直至压强相等：$n \\propto 1/T$，", "$P$、$V$ 固定，$8320 \\times (1 - 293/303) = \\qty{275}{mol}$，\\qty{8}{kg}", "逸出。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $\\rho = PM/RT$：\\qty{293}{K} 时为 \\qty{1.205}{kg/m^3}；", "\\qty{373}{K} 时为 \\qty{0.946}{kg/m^3}。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 热空气 $0.946 \\times 2800 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{26.0}{kN}$；被排开的", "冷空气 $1.205 \\times 2800 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{33.1}{kN}$；升力 \\qty{7.1}{kN}", "（\\qty{725}{kg}）。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $725 - 300 = \\qty{425}{kg}$：五名乘客。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 升力 $\\propto \\rho_c - \\rho_h = \\rho_c(1 - 293/T)$：要使升力加倍，", "此时 $1 - 293/373 = 0.215$，需 $T = 293/0.57 = \\qty{514}{K}$（\\qty{240}{\\degreeCelsius}），", "远超尼龙所能承受的温度（约 \\qty{120}{\\degreeCelsius}）。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 氦气 $\\rho = 1.205 \\times 4/29 = \\qty{0.166}{kg/m^3}$：升力", "$(1.205 - 0.166) \\times 2800 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{28.5}{kN}$（\\qty{2.9}{t}），约为前者的", "四倍 --- 但氦气昂贵，每次着陆都会流失，而", "热空气免费，其升力可用燃烧器调节。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $0.21 \\times 1.013\\times10^5 = \\qty{2.1e4}{Pa}$。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $n^*_{\\mathrm{O}_2} = P_{\\mathrm{O}_2}/k_BT$：室内 $2.1\\times10^4/", "(1.38\\times10^{-23} \\times 293) = \\qty{5.3e24}{m^{-3}}$；珠穆朗玛峰 $0.21 \\times 0.33", "\\times 1.013\\times10^5/(1.38\\times10^{-23} \\times 250) = \\qty{2.0e24}{m^{-3}}$，", "是室内的 $38\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $H = RT/Mg = 8.314 \\times 260/(0.029 \\times 9.81) = \\qty{7.6}{km}$；", "压强为 $P_0/2$ 的高度为 $H\\ln 2 = \\qty{5.3}{km}$。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $c_s = \\sqrt{1.4 \\times 8.314 \\times 293/0.029} = \\qty{343}{m/s}$，", "与混合气体的 $u = \\qty{503}{m/s}$ 相比：$c_s/u = \\sqrt{\\gamma/3} = 0.68$。", "声音是由分子本身传递的扰动，因此它", "传播速率与分子速率同量级 --- 略小一些，", "因为只有沿传播方向的分量才起作用。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $c_s \\propto \\sqrt T$：$343\\sqrt{303/293} = \\qty{349}{m/s}$。", "氦气：$\\sqrt{(5/3) \\times 8.314 \\times 293/0.004} = \\qty{1010}{m/s}$：", "声道的共振与 $c_s$ 成正比，故每个共振峰", "都升高为原来的三倍。", "", "\\textbf{22.} 更冷时：$343\\sqrt{250/293} = \\qty{317}{m/s}$，慢 $8\\%$；", "与压强无关。", "", "\\textbf{23.} $N$ 不变（$P$、$V$、$T$ 均相同）；质量 $\\times 40/29 = \\qty{333}{kg}$；", "速率 $\\times\\sqrt{29/40}$：$u = \\qty{428}{m/s}$；$U = \\tfrac32 nRT$，代替", "$\\tfrac52$：$60\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{24.} $U = \\tfrac52 \\times 8320 \\times 8.314 \\times 293 = \\qty{5.1e7}{J}$；", "$\\Delta U = \\tfrac52 nR \\times 10 = \\qty{1.7e6}{J}$。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 一个平均量 $\\langle v^2\\rangle$ 决定了压强", "（$\\tfrac13 n^*m\\langle v^2\\rangle$），定义了温度", "（$\\tfrac12 m\\langle v^2\\rangle = \\tfrac32 k_BT$），给出了状态方程", "以及内能，并确定了声速的量级。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}